    "detailed_description": "Night Horde is a wave survival game that focuses on strategy and building. Night Horde has a skill system so you can level up your favorite class with different skillsets and abilities. Classes include: Paladin, Mage, Archer, and Berserker. Every class has unique weapons and skills specific to that class, all with their own uses and playstyles. There is also a single player mode that gives the game a spin on what you will find in multiplayer.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSo, are you ready to take on hordes of monsters?",
